{"id": "gong9-2025-08-네트워크보안", "exam": "gong9", "group": "국가직 9급", "year": 2025, "subject": "네트워크보안", "exams": ["9급 공개경쟁채용시험"], "booklet": "나", "answersFinal": true, "choices": 4, "pdf": "gong9-cabb6a411482", "width": 728.0, "height": 1031.0, "pages": 2, "questions": [{"no": 1, "regions": [{"page": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 104.0, "x1": 362.0, "y1": 243.9}], "text": "1. 정보보안 3대 요소 중 서비스 거부(Denial of Service) 공격의\n침해 대상은?\n①가용성\n②기밀성\n③무결성\n④익명성", "choices": [{"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 150.5, "x1": 362.0, "y1": 174.5, "m": [37.8, 153.5, 48.3, 166.7]}, {"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 174.5, "x1": 362.0, "y1": 198.6, "m": [37.8, 177.5, 48.3, 190.7]}, {"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 198.6, "x1": 362.0, "y1": 222.7, "m": [37.8, 201.6, 48.3, 214.8]}, {"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 222.7, "x1": 362.0, "y1": 243.9, "m": [37.8, 225.7, 48.3, 238.9]}], "answer": [1]}, {"no": 2, "regions": [{"page": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 272.6, "x1": 362.0, "y1": 412.3}], "text": "2. 네트워크에서 서버의 작동과 서버가 제공하는 서비스 존재 여부를\n확인하는 것은?\n①스캐닝(scanning)\n②스미싱(SMishing)\n③스위칭(switching)\n④스풀링(SPOOLing)", "choices": [{"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 318.8, "x1": 362.0, "y1": 342.9, "m": [37.8, 321.8, 48.3, 335.1]}, {"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 342.9, "x1": 362.0, "y1": 367.0, "m": [37.8, 345.9, 48.3, 359.2]}, {"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 367.0, "x1": 362.0, "y1": 391.0, "m": [37.8, 370.0, 48.3, 383.3]}, {"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 391.0, "x1": 362.0, "y1": 412.3, "m": [37.8, 394.0, 48.3, 407.3]}], "answer": [1]}, {"no": 3, "regions": [{"page": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 441.0, "x1": 362.0, "y1": 556.6}], "text": "3. 응용계층 프로토콜로 옳지 않은 것은?\n①FTP(File Transfer Protocol)\n②SCTP(Stream Control Transmission Protocol)\n③SMTP(Simple Mail Transfer Protocol)\n④Telnet", "choices": [{"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 463.2, "x1": 362.0, "y1": 487.3, "m": [37.8, 466.2, 48.3, 479.5]}, {"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 487.3, "x1": 362.0, "y1": 511.4, "m": [37.8, 490.3, 48.3, 503.6]}, {"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 511.4, "x1": 362.0, "y1": 535.4, "m": [37.8, 514.4, 48.3, 527.7]}, {"r": 0, 